<title>HONG KONG: Kwangju Bank launches US$50 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Kwangju Bank launches US$50 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Standard Chartered Investment Banking.</p>
<p> BORROWER KWANGJU BANK			   GUARANTOR   --</p>
<p> AMT	US$50 MLN   COUPON    6ML+45     MATURITY    3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	   ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    16.SEP.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	  CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES     --</p>
<p> LISTING  LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	--</p>
<p> RATINGS  --	    SALE LMTS CUSTOMARY</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY S.KOREA    TAX PROV    STANDARD</p>
<p> PAY DATE 25.OCT.96   NOTES     FOR GENERAL WORKING CAPITAL</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES  CO-LEADS  US$5 MLN+  21 BP ALL-IN 52</p>
<p>			    CO-MGRS   US$2-4 MLN 18 BP ALL-IN 51</p>
<p> ARRANGER  KDB ASIA, CITICORP INTERNATIONAL, LTCB ASIA,</p>
<p>	     STANDARD CHARTERED INVESTMENT BANKING</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
